  doit throughput [--hours N] [--json]    read-only merge queue, wait, rate and verification metrics
  doit problems [--open] [--json] [--needs-statement] [--health] [--config PATH]
                                           the ledger folded into recurring problems (L-charter-0034)
  doit packet <role> <subject> [...]      build that role's packet from the ledger (-h for flags)
  doit audit cut|plan <charter> --cut F [...]  the six mechanical checks under both fable audits (§3.6)
